{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 940,
      "hub_id": 1283,
      "guid": "com.icyclawz.itemcontextmenuext",
      "name": "Item Context Menu Extended",
      "slug": "item-context-menu-extended",
      "teaser": "A mod that adds extra context menu items for specific item types and allows changing the scaling of context menus.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1283.png",
      "downloads": 20815,
      "favourites_count": 23,
      "description": "<p><strong>Installation:</strong></p>\n<p>Extract the ZIP to your SPT-AKI installation folder.</p>\n<p>Note: This mod depends on my “<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/938/custom-interactions\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Custom Interactions</a>” library.</p>\n<p><strong>Description:</strong></p>\n<p>Currently included custom context menu items:</p>\n<p>* “<strong>Firing mode</strong>” for weapons.<br />\n* “<strong>Active scope</strong>”, “<strong>Active mode</strong>” (incl. zoom) and “<strong>Zero distance</strong>” for sights.<br />\n* “<strong>Turn on/off</strong>” and “<strong>Active mode</strong>” for tactical devices.</p>\n<p>Note: Auxillary scopes and sight/tactical modes have no names in the game, just an index.</p>\n<p>You can change the context menu scaling from the mod’s settings.</p>\n<p>If you have an idea of a useful menu item that should be added, let me know in the comments.<br />\nOnly no-nonsense ideas will be considered.</p>\n<p><strong>Important</strong>: The game does not have a facility for saving any of these interactions to your server-side profile directly because they are literally impossible to do outside of raid. That will require a custom server-side solution I may include in a later version. If you use any of these interactions outside of raid, they will persist as long as the game is running, but will be saved server-side only when you enter a raid and then extract from it, with those items being in your gear.</p>\n<p>A few screenshots:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ikxxkZ9.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qOzuCCu.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71pJRw2.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6OaXNby.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/940/item-context-menu-extended",
      "fika_compatibility": false,
      "featured": false,
      "contains_ads": false,
